WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
One image can look ordinary upside down—and strange when upright.
The image has not changed.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The classic Thatcher illusion shows how orientation changes
what we notice in a face.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Later studies found important limits,
even using objects other than faces.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
This does not prove that an audio program
can change your brain, health, or finances.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
If short guided meditation appeals to you,
start with a free twelve-minute baseline.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then compare actual features and evidence before you decide.
Source before story.
